{"t":"REG","made":"2026-11-12 00:07","name":"Regency Centers Corporation","ko":null,"sector":"Real Estate","industry":"REIT - Retail","employees":503,"hq":"Jacksonville, FL, United States","website":"https://www.regencycenters.com","summary_en":"Regency Centers Corporation is a pre-eminent national owner, operator, and developer of shopping centers located in suburban trade areas with compelling demographics. Our portfolio includes thriving properties merchandised with highly productive grocers, restaurants, service providers, and best-in-class retailers that connect to their neighborhoods, communities, and customers. Operating as a fully integrated real estate company, Regency Centers is a qualified real estate investment trust (REIT) that is self-administered, self-managed, and an S&P 500 Index member. Regency Centers Corporation was incorporated in 1963 and is based in Jacksonville, Florida.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Regency Centers Corporation은 매력적인 인구 통계를 지닌 교외 무역 지역에 위치한 쇼핑 센터의 저명한 국내 소유주, 운영자 및 개발업체입니다. 우리의 포트폴리오에는 생산성이 높은 식료품점, 레스토랑, 서비스 제공업체 및 이웃, 지역 사회 및 고객과 연결되는 동급 최고의 소매업체와 함께 상품을 판매하는 번창하는 부동산이 포함됩니다. 완전히 통합된 부동산 회사로 운영되는 Regency Centers는 자체 관리되고 S&P 500 지수 회원인 적격 부동산 투자 신탁(REIT)입니다. Regency Centers Corporation은 1963년에 설립되었으며 플로리다 주 잭슨빌에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":75.89,"mcap":14188642304.0,"pe":27.200718,"fpe":30.358793,"peg":null,"ps":8.269129,"pb":2.101401,"ev_ebitda":17.793,"div":4.18,"beta":0.817,"hi52":83.66,"lo52":66.86},"fin":{"rev":1715857024.0,"rev_g":0.075,"eps_g":-0.293,"gross":0.71497,"op":0.39962003,"net":0.30616,"roe":0.07666,"fcf":751929472.0,"cash":144082000.0,"debt":5126384128.0,"de":72.246,"eps":2.79,"feps":2.49977},"own":{"short":0.0531,"inst":1.04084,"insider":0.0064700004},"analyst":{"n":18,"mean":84.27778,"median":84.5,"high":94.0,"low":76.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":2.05,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":5,"buy":7,"hold":8,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":5,"buy":7,"hold":8,"sell